# Trivy ignore file — plain text format, one check ID per line.
# Path-scoped suppression is not supported here; see REPOSITORY_TRIVY_ARGUMENTS
# in .mega-linter.yml for --skip-files targeting Kustomize patch files.
#
# Overlay patches (overlays/dev/deployment.yaml, overlays/prod/deployment.yaml)
# are excluded via --skip-files because Trivy scans them as standalone Deployments
# without the base securityContext. They are Kustomize patches, not full manifests.
#
# Kyverno test fixtures under kyverno/tests/resources/fail-*.yaml are intentionally
# non-compliant for specific policy rules only; all other security controls are set.
